{"id":91,"name":"الشمس","transliteration":"Ash-Shams","translation_fr":"Le soleil","translation_en":"The Sun","type":"meccan","total_verses":15,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَٱلشَّمۡسِ وَضُحَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Par le soleil et par sa clarté","translation_en":"By the sun and its brightness","transliteration":"Waalshshamsi waduhaha"},{"id":2,"text":"وَٱلۡقَمَرِ إِذَا تَلَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Et par la lune quand elle le suit","translation_en":"And [by] the moon when it follows it","transliteration":"Waalqamari itha talaha"},{"id":3,"text":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ إِذَا جَلَّىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Et par le jour quand il l'éclaire","translation_en":"And [by] the day when it displays it","transliteration":"Waalnnahari itha jallaha"},{"id":4,"text":"وَٱلَّيۡلِ إِذَا يَغۡشَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Et par la nuit quand elle l'enveloppe","translation_en":"And [by] the night when it covers it","transliteration":"Waallayli itha yaghshaha"},{"id":5,"text":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَمَا بَنَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Et par le ciel et Celui qui l'a construit","translation_en":"And [by] the sky and He who constructed it","transliteration":"Waalssamai wama banaha"},{"id":6,"text":"وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَمَا طَحَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Et par la terre et Celui qui l'a étendue","translation_en":"And [by] the earth and He who spread it","transliteration":"Waalardi wama tahaha"},{"id":7,"text":"وَنَفۡسٖ وَمَا سَوَّىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Et par l'âme et Celui qui l'a harmonieusement façonnée","translation_en":"And [by] the soul and He who proportioned it","transliteration":"Wanafsin wama sawwaha"},{"id":8,"text":"فَأَلۡهَمَهَا فُجُورَهَا وَتَقۡوَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"et lui a alors inspiré son immoralité, de même que sa piété","translation_en":"And inspired it [with discernment of] its wickedness and its righteousness","transliteration":"Faalhamaha fujooraha wataqwaha"},{"id":9,"text":"قَدۡ أَفۡلَحَ مَن زَكَّىٰهَا","translation_fr":"A réussi, certes, celui qui la purifie","translation_en":"He has succeeded who purifies it","transliteration":"Qad aflaha man zakkaha"},{"id":10,"text":"وَقَدۡ خَابَ مَن دَسَّىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Et est perdu, certes, celui qui la corrompt","translation_en":"And he has failed who instills it [with corruption]","transliteration":"Waqad khaba man dassaha"},{"id":11,"text":"كَذَّبَتۡ ثَمُودُ بِطَغۡوَىٰهَآ","translation_fr":"Les Thamûd, par leur transgression, ont crié au mensonge","translation_en":"Thamud denied [their prophet] by reason of their transgression","transliteration":"Kaththabat thamoodu bitaghwaha"},{"id":12,"text":"إِذِ ٱنۢبَعَثَ أَشۡقَىٰهَا","translation_fr":"lorsque le plus misérable d'entre eux se leva (pour tuer la chamelle)","translation_en":"When the most wretched of them was sent forth","transliteration":"Ithi inbaAAatha ashqaha"},{"id":13,"text":"فَقَالَ لَهُمۡ رَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ نَاقَةَ ٱللَّهِ وَسُقۡيَٰهَا","translation_fr":"Le Messager d'Allah leur avait dit: «La chamelle d'Allah! Laissez-la boire","translation_en":"And the messenger of Allah [Salih] said to them, \"[Do not harm] the she-camel of Allah or [prevent her from] her drink","transliteration":"Faqala lahum rasoolu Allahi naqata Allahi wasuqyaha"},{"id":14,"text":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَعَقَرُوهَا فَدَمۡدَمَ عَلَيۡهِمۡ رَبُّهُم بِذَنۢبِهِمۡ فَسَوَّىٰهَا","translation_fr":"Mais, ils le traitèrent de menteur, et la tuèrent. Leur Seigneur les détruisit donc, pour leur péché et étendit Son châtiment sur tous","translation_en":"But they denied him and hamstrung her. So their Lord brought down upon them destruction for their sin and made it equal [upon all of them]","transliteration":"Fakaththaboohu faAAaqarooha fadamdama AAalayhim rabbuhum bithanbihim fasawwaha"},{"id":15,"text":"وَلَا يَخَافُ عُقۡبَٰهَا","translation_fr":"Et Allah n'a aucune crainte des conséquences","translation_en":"And He does not fear the consequence thereof","transliteration":"Wala yakhafu AAuqbaha"}]}